                 1282 ;
                 1283 ;
                 1284 ;       THIS ROUTINE DECIDES WHETHER TO INCREMENT
                 1285 ;       THE TRACK NUMBER OR TO CHANGE SIDES WHEN
                 1286 ;       LOOKING FOR THE NEXT TRACK
